  \item A reproducible, leakage-aware data pipeline from nine raw Excel workbooks to a frozen ML-ready dataset, with every cleaning decision counted and documented.
  \item A compact XGBoost defender that can be re-scored at every step of an attack, evaluated with imbalance-aware metrics on a temporal split.
