Action & One continuous value in $[-1,1]$ (the Stable-Baselines3 convention), rescaled to $[0,1]$ inside the environment: the \emph{fraction of the remaining budget to submit} at this step \\
Transition & The chosen amount is written into a copy of the baseline row with \texttt{encode\_amount\_only()} and scored by \texttt{defender\_v1} \\
Not caught (score below threshold) & The amount is banked, the budget shrinks and the episode continues, up to five steps or until the budget is exhausted \\
Caught (score at or above threshold) & The episode ends immediately, the whole remaining budget $R_t$ (including the flagged sub-claim) is forfeited, and a penalty of $1.5\,R_t/B$ is applied (see the reward function below); rewards banked at earlier steps are kept \\
