\section{Synthetic Data}
\begin{itemize}[nosep]
  \item Conclusions hold only as far as CTGAN claims resemble real ones. About 3\% of generated amounts fell below 1.0 AED (most of them negative) and were clipped to 1.0 AED; a small negative net premium remains.
